   [REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] SLA 2.5 section 1.3(b) forbids
   distributing "the corresponding, separate header files" and building
   developer tools from the SDK. ueiopcuasdk-dev (headers) and ueiopcuasdk-
   staticdev must never be installed in an image or shipped in a Yocto
   SDK/eSDK. Today only the runtime package ueiopcuasdk (libuastack.so) is
   in uei-image-sec-minimal.


