External components (not included in this directory)
----------------------------------------------------
libuastack.so dynamically links OpenSSL (openssl recipe, Apache-2.0).
lic/OpenSSL_license.txt in the SDK refers to that external library.


Files not built/installed for the ARM (SoloX) target
----------------------------------------------------
Windows builds, examples, documentation and tools in the SDK tree are not
part of the package.


[REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] Confirm with Unified Automation which
parts of the ANSI C stack (uastack) are under the OPC Foundation MIT
license vs. the SLA.


